{
  "id": "electrical_motors___shaft_power_vs__voltage_and_cu",
  "title": "Electrical Motors - Shaft Power vs. Voltage and Current",
  "description": "Calculate shaft power produced by electrical motors in watts and horsepower. Supports DC and AC (single phase, two phase, three phase) motors with adjustable voltage, current, motor efficiency, and power factor.",
  "type": "calculator-chart",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Electrical Motors - Shaft Power Calculator\n\nPower is rated in **watt (W)** or **horsepower (hp)**.\n- **1 hp = 746 watts = 0.76 kW**\n- **1 watt = 1 / 746 hp**\n\n### Shaft Power Formulas\n\n**DC Motor:**\n- Pshaft_kW = ηm × U × I / 1000\n\n**AC Motor - Single Phase:**\n- Pshaft_kW = ηm × U × I × PF / 1000\n\n**AC Motor - Three Phase:**\n- Pshaft_kW = ηm × 1.73 × U × I × PF / 1000\n\n**Conversion to Horsepower:**\n- Pshaft_hp = Pshaft_kW / 0.746"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "motorType",
          "label": "Motor Type",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "DC Motor",
              "value": "dc"
            },
            {
              "label": "AC Single Phase",
              "value": "ac_single"
            },
            {
              "label": "AC Three Phase",
              "value": "ac_three"
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": "dc"
        },
        {
          "id": "voltage",
          "label": "Voltage",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "V",
          "defaultValue": 36
        },
        {
          "id": "current",
          "label": "Current",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "A",
          "defaultValue": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "efficiency",
          "label": "Motor Efficiency",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "%",
          "defaultValue": 85
        },
        {
          "id": "powerFactor",
          "label": "Power Factor (AC only)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "",
          "defaultValue": 0.9
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "powerKW",
          "label": "Shaft Power",
          "unit": "kW",
          "formula": "inputs.efficiency / 100 * inputs.voltage * inputs.current / 1000",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "powerHP",
          "label": "Shaft Power",
          "unit": "hp",
          "formula": "inputs.efficiency / 100 * inputs.voltage * inputs.current / 1000 / 0.746",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "powerW",
          "label": "Shaft Power",
          "unit": "W",
          "formula": "inputs.efficiency / 100 * inputs.voltage * inputs.current",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
